what made this time so special.🤩 The weeks before Gamescom were filled with preparation to make a polished, enjoyable demo for the Gamescom visitors who were willing to spend their ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T12:04:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814446259","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3623230-1830797770244949","game_id":"steam-3623230","kind":"update","title":"Midnight Souvenirs: Dev Update!","summary":"Hi everyone and welcome to our next Midnight Souvenirs Dev Update! Today we want to talk a bit about our hint system design and how we implemented it to fit into our world-building. To be honest, we as a mini indie team of 3 devs love a good challenge in games, especially when it's about finding hidden objects or solving puzzles. But we totally get that a hint system can be super helpful to prevent frustration, focusing more on world-building, or sometimes you just don’t feel like you want to ha","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-28T11:09:37Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1830797770244949","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:42Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3623230-1822556746168924","game_id":"steam-3623230","kind":"update","title":"Midnight Souvenirs: Dev Update!","summary":"Hey everyone! Isabel & Alexa here from PathOfPixels and we want to welcome you to our first Midnight Souvenirs developer announcement here on Steam!We're really happy to finally post on here beside our social media channels and share the different updates and development stages with you. We’ve been working hard behind the scenes and development is moving along nicely. Right now, a big focus is on creating more art con